# Mise operational backend

Mise is an autonomous restaurant operations backend with a calm mobile control surface.

Authoritative spec: `docs/MISE_OPERATIONAL_BACKEND_MASTER_PROMPT.md`
Plan/audit: `docs/operational-backend/`

## Non-negotiables

- Do not build generic dashboards or fake AI behavior.
- Every recommendation must be grounded in structured evidence.
- Every action must be permissioned and auditable.
- Every meaningful system event must create a truthful activity record.
- Preserve tenant isolation, source-of-truth boundaries, and existing Mise branding.
- LLM may explain/summarize; never invent inventory quantities, prices, permissions, or integration success.
- Prefer incremental vertical slices over disconnected mock screens.
- Demo data must be internally consistent and clearly labeled; production must not silently fall back to demo.
